      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEV THE GOAT NZ (3) found her best form when she came from this barrier to score by 12.5 metres last week, adding to a good record at this circuit and distance. Stays in the same grade so could back that up. WHERES MY REASON (8) came from this row when she scored last time out by 4.2 metres at Newcastle. Reliable mare who has only once missed the top-three in her last seven appearances. Could go on with it. TOMAHAWK BART (9) may need luck from this barrier but will find this easier than the last attempt at Menangle and was going well prior including a win the last time he raced here last month. FIRE FOX NZ (10) deserves respect after he raced three wide from this row but stuck on for second to Bev the Goat last week.",
